 {
  "name": "Ex-Div and Pay Day: the next distribution still to be paid, from the exchange's record where the company's publication has not listed it yet",
  "spec": "SPEC.md §5 Cashflow Positions: Ex-Div and Pay Day",
  "working": [
   "declared is the fund company's own publication (the record the rate comes from); market_declared is the exchange's (TMX) record of the same fund, read beside it",
   "Ex-Div: 'the ex-date of the next distribution still to be paid, whether or not it has gone ex; when nothing is left to pay, of the last known one'; where the company's record 'lists nothing still to be paid, the exchange's record (TMX) is read beside it ... the next distribution TMX lists after the company's latest is the one still to be paid'. Pay Day is the pay date of that same distribution. Today 2026-09-26.",
   "H: the company's latest, ex 2026-08-31 paid 2026-09-04, is paid; TMX lists ex 2026-09-29 paid 2026-10-06 after it: 2026-09-29 / 2026-10-06.",
   "L: the company's own record lists ex 2026-09-29 paid 2026-10-07, still to be paid: TMX is not consulted: 2026-09-29 / 2026-10-07.",
   "S: the company's latest is paid; TMX lists nothing after ex 2026-08-31 (its row for that same ex-date with pay 2026-09-30 is not after it): the last known one, 2026-08-31 / 2026-09-04."
  ],
